---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/RealestateLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="North York Real Estate | Neighbourhood Profile | Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent"
  description="North York neighbourhood profile covering Willowdale, Don Mills, Bayview Village, and Newtonbrook. Housing types, price ranges, transit, schools, and market insights from Cory Wong."
  canonicalPath="/neighbourhoods/north-york"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">North York</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__subtitle">Neighbourhood Profile</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profile Content -->
  <article class="profile">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <div class="profile__intro">
        <p>
          North York sits at the geographic centre of Toronto, offering a rare combination of
          urban density along the Yonge corridor and quiet, established residential streets
          just minutes away. With two subway lines, strong schools, and a housing stock that
          ranges from 1960s bungalows to brand-new high-rise condos, North York appeals to a
          wide spectrum of buyers &mdash; from first-time purchasers to families looking for
          their long-term home.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Character and Feel -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Character and Feel</h2>
        <p>
          North York is defined by contrast. The Yonge corridor between Finch and Sheppard
          has transformed into a dense, transit-oriented urban centre with glass towers,
          restaurants, and retail. Step a few blocks east or west and you're in tree-lined
          residential neighbourhoods with detached homes on generous lots.
        </p>
        <p>
          Willowdale is the largest and most active area &mdash; split between the condo-heavy
          corridor and quiet residential streets. Don Mills is an established, mature
          neighbourhood with a mid-century suburban character and strong community feel.
          Bayview Village is one of North York's most desirable pockets, with larger homes,
          excellent schools, and proximity to upscale shopping. Newtonbrook, straddling the
          Yonge line near Finch, offers a mix of condos and older detached homes with strong
          transit access.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Who Buys -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Who Buys in North York</h2>
        <p>
          First-time buyers are drawn to condos near Yonge and Sheppard or Yonge and Finch,
          where subway access and relative affordability create a strong entry point into the
          market. Move-up buyers target freehold homes in Bayview Village, Willowdale East,
          and Don Mills &mdash; areas with established streetscapes, mature trees, and top-tier
          school catchments. Investors remain active in the condo segment along the Yonge
          corridor, particularly near subway stations and the growing number of commercial
          and institutional tenants in the area.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Housing Types and Price Ranges -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Housing Types and Price Ranges</h2>
        <ul class="profile__price-list">
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Detached (Bayview Village)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$1.8M &ndash; $2.5M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Detached (Willowdale, Don Mills)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$1.3M &ndash; $2M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Semi-detached</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$850K &ndash; $1.3M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Condos (Yonge corridor)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$500K &ndash; $900K</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="profile__price-note">
          Bayview Village commands a premium due to school catchments, lot sizes, and
          proximity to Bayview Village shops and transit.
        </p>
        <p class="profile__price-disclaimer">
          These are general estimates based on market activity in early 2026. Actual prices
          vary by property. Speak with Cory for a current assessment.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Transit and Highways -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Transit and Highways</h2>
        <p>
          North York has some of the best transit access in the GTA. The TTC's Yonge line runs
          through the heart of the area, with stations at Finch, North York Centre, Sheppard-Yonge,
          and Bayview. The Sheppard line extends east from Sheppard-Yonge to Don Mills, connecting
          key residential areas to the subway network. Extensive bus routes supplement rail service
          across the district.
        </p>
        <p>
          Highway 401 runs through North York and the Don Valley Parkway (DVP) provides a
          direct route to downtown. For drivers, the central location means relatively balanced
          commute times in all directions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Amenities and Schools -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Amenities and Schools</h2>
        <p>
          Mel Lastman Square anchors the North York Civic Centre area and hosts seasonal events,
          a skating rink, and community programming. The North York Central Library is one of
          the largest public library branches in the city. Bayview Village Shopping Centre
          offers upscale retail, while Fairview Mall serves the eastern part of the district
          with a broad range of stores and services.
        </p>
        <p>
          Schools are a significant draw. Earl Haig Secondary School is one of the most
          sought-after public high schools in Toronto, known for its Claude Watson Arts
          Program. A.Y. Jackson Secondary School and Don Mills Collegiate Institute are also
          highly regarded. Properties within top school catchments carry a measurable premium,
          and school boundaries are a major factor in buying decisions across North York.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Real Estate Perspective -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Real Estate Perspective</h2>
        <p>
          The condo market near Yonge and Sheppard has seen elevated supply, driven by a wave
          of new construction completions and investor-owned units entering the resale market.
          This has created genuine opportunity for first-time buyers who can take advantage of
          increased selection and more negotiable pricing.
        </p>
        <p>
          Freehold homes in established areas &mdash; particularly Bayview Village, Willowdale
          East, and the quieter streets of Don Mills &mdash; continue to hold their value well.
          Demand from families prioritizing school catchments and neighbourhood character keeps
          these segments resilient, even as the broader market adjusts. For sellers in these
          areas, accurate pricing remains essential, but well-presented homes in desirable
          pockets continue to attract strong interest.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="profile__cta">
        <a href="/contact" class="cta cta--primary">Discuss North York Real Estate with Cory</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Compliance -->
      <div class="profile__compliance">
        <p>
          Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent. Real estate services provided through Trustwell
          Realty Inc., Brokerage. Information is believed to be accurate but is not guaranteed.
          Speak with Cory for advice specific to your situation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- Newsletter -->
  <section class="newsletter">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="newsletter__heading">Stay Informed</h2>
      <p class="newsletter__text">
        Get monthly market data, neighbourhood insights, and practical advice for buyers
        and sellers across the Greater Toronto Area.
      </p>
      <form id="newsletter-form" class="newsletter__form" novalidate>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="newsletter-email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="you@example.com"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          class="newsletter__input"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="cta cta--primary newsletter__btn">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p id="newsletter-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  const newsletterForm = document.getElementById('newsletter-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const newsletterStatus = document.getElementById('newsletter-form-status');

  if (newsletterForm && newsletterStatus) {
    newsletterForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      newsletterStatus.textContent = '';
      newsletterStatus.className = 'form-status';

      const formData = new FormData(newsletterForm);
      const payload = {
        type: 'newsletter',
        email: formData.get('email'),
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/lead', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          newsletterStatus.textContent = 'You\'re subscribed! Watch your inbox for the next report.';
          newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--success');
          newsletterForm.reset();
        } else {
          throw new Error('Request failed');
        }
      } catch {
        newsletterStatus.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
        newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--error');
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .content-narrow {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .page-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Profile */
  .profile {
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .profile__intro {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__intro p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .profile__section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .profile__section-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__section p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Price List */
  .profile__price-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__price-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .profile__price-list li:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__price-label {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .profile__price-value {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: right;
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__price-note {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .profile__price-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .profile__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* Compliance */
  .profile__compliance {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__compliance p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .newsletter {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .newsletter__heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .newsletter__form {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .newsletter__input {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .newsletter__input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ffffff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .newsletter__btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .newsletter__btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .form-status {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    min-height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--success {
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--error {
    color: #fecaca;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .profile__price-list li {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }

    .profile__price-value {
      text-align: left;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .newsletter__form {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
